  "details": "Per the 1484 update:\n\n\"Changed the default binding for menu grabbing to require a full squeeze on Index Controllers.\n\nNote that you don't need to hold the squeeze, and you can still un-grab by taking your fingers off the grip sensor.\"\n\nHowever, I'm barely touching my controllers and whenever I open something like that keyboard, it's \"sticking\" to my hands, even when I don't touch the triggers. \n\nI have to open the keyboard, move both hands away from the keyboard, then grip the controllers so the keyboard doesn't attach to my hand and I can type.",
